direction_34 = location "Bulcan" about "Bulcan\nRepresentative monster of Moradon which refines traces of steel from the earth in its stomach" found "Moradon seashore" at 535 414 in zone 21

On offer
    Say "Another day in thriving Moradon! What do you want?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "I received word that peddlers are having a hard time traveling due to Bulcans lurking in the sand plains. Moradon is a quasi-desert with 80% of the terrain covered with sand. Their numbers are sure to grow if they go unchecked. Do you think it's possible for you to wipe out the Bulcans inhabiting the sand?"

On in_progress
    Say "In order to guarantee the safety of the peddlers, at least five Bulcans must be caught."
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_34

On ready
    Say "I caught all of 5 Bulcans. Let's go back to [Guard] Patrick."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Excellent. Thanks to you the number of Bulcans have declined markedly. Thank you."
